                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The effort put into this game is downright shameful.\nThe story is pathetic.\nArchemides is an idiot in this game; there’s nothing inventive about it.\nThere are no difficulty levels, so you must always hurry if you want all three stars—and you have to be flawless.\nThe gameplay is terribly complex and also stupid. Slow and boring.\nAchievements are either about perfection or about a whole lot of grinding.\nThis game is even worse than their other games—and by quite a lot.\nThis is a pathetic game.",
